<title>USA: Waters shareholders to sell 2.0 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Waters shareholders to sell 2.0 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Waters Corp said Thursday in a registration with the Securities and Exchange commission its shareholders will sell up to 2,031,904 common shares.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Merrill Lynch &amp; Co. After the offering, the outstanding shares will total 28,897,821 common.</p>
<p>The Milford, Mass., company is a manufacturer, distributor and provider of high performance liquid chromatography instruments, chromatography columns and other consumables, and related services.</p>
</text>
